---
import RoleTicker from './RoleTicker.astro';
import BrandArc from './BrandArc.astro';
---

<section class="industry">
  <div class="container industry__split">
    <div class="industry__media" data-reveal>
      <img
        src="/images/industry-professionals-bg.jpg"
        alt=""
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="industry__text" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">Industry Expertise</span>
      <p class="industry__intro">
        We understand the challenges faced by network operators and the expertise required to
        drive operational success. That's why CHIME was developed with insights from professionals
        across the industry, ensuring it meets the real-world needs of those working on the front
        lines.
      </p>

      <div class="industry__divider"></div>

      <div class="industry__professionals">
        <h3>Industry Professionals</h3>
        <p>
          At the heart of every successful network operation are the dedicated professionals who
          bring expertise, precision, and innovation to their roles. From design and construction
          to maintenance and oversight, these specialists ensure the seamless function and
          evolution of critical infrastructure.
        </p>
        <p>
          CHIME is built on the collective experience of these industry experts, offering
          solutions to those shaping the future of network operations.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="industry__ticker-band">
    <BrandArc size={480} anchor="bottom-left" style="bottom: -140px; left: -140px;" />
    <RoleTicker />
  </div>

  <div class="container industry__clear-horizon" data-reveal>
    <span class="industry__clear-horizon-label">Clear Horizon</span>
    <p>
      Our team specialises in the business of regulated network operators. We have consultants
      with over 20 years industry experience combined with highly skilled business analysts,
      solution design and secure enterprise IT service architecture. Our reputation at the most
      senior levels in the industry is built on the strength of our exceptional team.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .industry {
    background: var(--color-white);
  }

  .industry__split {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4rem;
    padding-block: 7rem 6rem;
  }

  .industry__media {
    flex: 0 0 28.75rem;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    border-radius: 24px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--color-grey-100), #dce9f2 55%, #c9e4f0);
  }

  .industry__media img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .industry__text {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .industry__intro {
    font-size: 1.625rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .industry__divider {
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-grey-100);
    margin-block: 0.5rem;
  }

  .industry__professionals {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .industry__professionals h3 {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .industry__professionals p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-grey-600);
  }

  .industry__ticker-band {
    position: relative;
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, #e8f6fb, var(--color-grey-100) 60%);
    padding-block: 2.5rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .industry__clear-horizon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    padding-block: 4.5rem;
  }

  .industry__clear-horizon-label {
    flex: 0 0 13.75rem;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--color-grey-600);
  }

  .industry__clear-horizon p {
    flex: 1;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-grey-600);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .industry__split {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    .industry__clear-horizon {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
  }
</style>
